sequenceDiagram
    participant Doctor
    participant Web as Web app
    participant API
    participant PS as PrescriptionService
    participant PDF as PrescriptionPdfService
    participant Store as File storage
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Doctor->>Web: Press "Sign & print"
    Web->>API: Flush autosave, PATCH /prescriptions/id with all medicines
    Web->>API: GET /doctor-signatures/my
    Note over Web: No saved signature, so the sign dialog opens and the drawing is saved with POST /doctor-signatures
    Web->>API: POST /prescriptions/id/finalize with signatureImageUrl
    API->>PS: finalize
    PS->>DB: Check status DRAFT or AMENDED and at least one medicine
    PS->>DB: Set FINALIZED, signed_at, signature, clear pdf_url
    PS->>PDF: generatePdfUrl, best effort
    PDF->>Store: Upload PDF to prescriptions folder
    PS->>DB: Save pdf_url and history row FINALIZED
    Web->>API: GET /prescriptions/id/pdf
    API->>PDF: generatePdfBuffer, built fresh every time
    API-->>Web: application/pdf inline
    Web-->>Doctor: In-app PDF preview with Print
